// The `decimal` namespace (area 3, question 7). Each operation is bound to
// the Rust function of the same qualified name in `jadpo-value`.
//
// `/` divides two values of the same named type exactly; these operations
// divide values of different types, or round another way.

public library decimal {
    /// `dividend` divided by `divisor`, to the dividend's scale, rounded as
    /// `rounding` says. The divisor is never zero.
    function divide(dividend: T, divisor: U, rounding: Rounding) -> Decimal {}
}
